{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日有博主發佈最新統計數據，截至2026年第44周，統計周期覆蓋10月26日到11月1日，iPhone 18 Pro系列在國內市場的累計銷量約為689.27萬台。該系列9月18日正式開售，至今上市僅約六周時間，要是按照國行9999元的起售價粗略估算，這六周時間它在國內市場創造的零售總額已經接近700億元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585910.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.237541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:37:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"f24f7734ed21d89913dd667e7edbd3fd92ce6a6aa009bbd5685b52638ed0c612","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}